[01:01.800]
[01:05.760]See your face
[01:10.620]History is changing
[01:17.010]The prophecy in the fire
[01:21.720]Has burnt away what once was
[01:28.440]When I keep my silence
[01:33.060]You become language
[01:39.600]Before you take your leave
[01:44.190]Say not forever
[02:13.380]Before withering
[02:18.030]Trim the blooming
[02:24.570]The black smoke of fate
[02:29.100]Shrouds our faces
[02:35.940]When you close your eyes
[02:40.620]In eternal sleeplessness
[02:46.980]Even God cannot conceal
[02:51.720]The poems of early morning
[03:43.410]Please sound out no more
[03:48.030]Let the mists recede
[03:54.750]Love is an adventure
[03:59.370]And a feverish cold
[04:05.970]Year after year
[04:10.440]Vows made dinner
[04:17.070]Time is shot dead
[04:21.690]The shackles of this truth
[05:32.743]
